### 1. Anita (id=4) checks in
POST http://localhost:8080/api/attendance/check-in
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "employeeId": 4
}

### 2. Try checking in again - should return 409 (already checked in today)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/attendance/check-in
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "employeeId": 4
}

### 3. Anita checks out
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/attendance/check-out
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "employeeId": 4
}

### 4. Try checking out again - should return 400 (already checked out)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/attendance/check-out
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "employeeId": 4
}

### 5. Try checking out someone who never checked in (e.g. Vikram, id=5) - should return 400
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/attendance/check-out
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "employeeId": 5
}

### 6. See Anita's full attendance record
GET http://localhost:8080/api/attendance?employeeId=4

### 7.Raj
POST http://localhost:8080/api/attendance/check-in
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "employeeId": 3
}